===Etymology===
From {{der|en|gmh|Luccelemburc}}, from {{der|en|goh|Lucilinburhuc}}, ultimately from {{m|goh|luzil|t=little}} + {{m|goh|burg|t=castle}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*lūtilaz}} and {{m|gem-pro|*burgz}}. {{piecewise doublet|en|Littleborough|Littlebury}}.

